1
00:00:00,880 --> 00:00:04,510
Whoever wants me gone... the Jiang family's got your backs

2
00:00:07,600 --> 00:00:10,660
This is your grandson. You said it yourself

3
00:00:11,180 --> 00:00:16,890
You let him end up out there. At your age, how could you possibly still get pregnant?

4
00:00:16,890 --> 00:00:22,060
This is a hospital. How could I lie? You... mom

5
00:00:22,060 --> 00:00:28,396
Erzi begged me for years. I've tried everything. But this child is Jiang Jiang's only heir

6
00:00:28,396 --> 00:00:31,676
Last time, my husband was murdered with the nanny's help

7
00:00:31,676 --> 00:00:34,486
This time, I'll make your whole family pay in blood

8
00:00:34,486 --> 00:00:39,216
Xiaolan, come over and wash my feet. Zhang Guifang

9
00:00:39,216 --> 00:00:43,166
Don't push it too far. My precious son says

10
00:00:43,166 --> 00:00:47,946
he wants Grandma to serve him personally. If the service is bad

11
00:00:47,946 --> 00:00:51,816
he won't come out. Staying in there—who's worried?

12
00:00:52,820 --> 00:00:54,450
Honey, calm down

13
00:00:56,320 --> 00:01:00,470
Careful, she'll crush your baby. You're watching yourself

14
00:01:00,470 --> 00:01:05,110
The Jiang family always gets its due. Easy... right

15
01:01:11,670 --> 01:01:15,330
So wrong. That look of superiority

16
01:01:15,330 --> 01:01:19,810
That's not how you look at a daughter-in-law. When you calm down

17
01:01:22,740 --> 01:01:26,470
I'm carrying your child in here. Don't push me

